                        :ARG1 (p3 / perform-02
                            :ARG0 a8
                            :ARG1 (a6 / area
                                :mod (a / activity-06)))))))))

# ::tok The index is based on several parameters that are tested in each authority , and examines the level of " friendliness " of the authority to the businesses in its region .
